 up with a plan known as the Bansai attack.</p>\n<p>The plan was to charge the Americans with bayonets. I\u2019m not kidding. They formed massive groups of Japs and ran into machine gun fire, and tried to stab us with bayonets.</p>\n<p>The thing is, this plan would have worked if American soldiers were a bunch of panican doomers. They would have seen a large army running towards them screaming viciously, and Americans would have abandoned their posts allowing the outnumbered Americans to lose the battle.</p>\n<p>But they didn\u2019t do that. They maintained their posts and easily defeated the japs, inflicting 1000:1 casualties.</p>\n<p>We are facing the same thing today with the democrats. They have no real weapons. They have nothing to run on. We have 1000x as much money as them, literally. The best they can do is try to scare conservatives into abandoning the fight.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>oooooo we are coming for ya! CNN polls say you\u2019re down by 70 points. And once we regain power, we\u2019re gunna put ya in a gulag! We\u2019re gonna call you a pedophile! Your friends aren\u2019t gonna like you, weirdo! You betcha!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This has caused the weakest faggots in MAGA to abandon their posts, shriveling into a ball, crying about the end of the world. But all we need is a solid majority of the MAGA base to show up and vote during the midterms and we will crush the Democrats and finish the invasion of Tokyo.</p>\n<p>Remember, midterm elections are <em>base turnout elections.</em> Most normies don\u2019t even know they\u2019re happening and even fewer will be motivated enough to vote.</p>\n<p>Literally all we have to do to win is not panic, stop spazzing out about Democrat psyops, stay high energy, have 5% as much moxie as Charlie Kirk, get one of our friends to vote with us \u2014 and we win. It\u2019s not some insurmountable thing. We are not doomed. We just need to get off our ass a little bit.</p>\n<p>If we win the midterms we win the war. We will